        "best": true,
        "text": "Taxis meter fares. Grab and Gojek ride apps are widely used."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rental car",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Driving is possible but costly: ERP tolls, high parking and a car-ownership tax regime."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Walking",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Walking is pleasant in the core. Covered walkways help in rain and heat."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Ferry",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Ferries run from HarbourFront and Tanah Merah to the Riau Islands and Johor."
